    <title>Stowmap</title>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:29:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.5.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The access notice now checks whether macOS is really granting Full Disk Access and says what to do: re-add the app after an update, rescan, or nothing when the remaining folders belong to macOS. The question mark beside Hidden space opens a breakdown of what it contains.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.5.1/Stowmap-1.5.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="KzS6JxihT3WMh9h4y+6HbWJVP8DPnE3hq10FgxUuCnS4CdbyxugcLkNd1Q4LOmsG5J1Hl3c5Ll1Fdc4rRG2jAQ==" length="4332834" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.5</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:26:27 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Jobs on separate drives now run at the same time; jobs that share a drive or the network take turns. The queue is a column beside the copy form. The inner ring shows the whole queue, the graph covers the whole job, and the file list shows next, current and finished files. Drives, Duplicates and Copy &amp; Verify are tabs across the top. Duplicates: tick which drives to include.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.5/Stowmap-1.5.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="3N/1lzXo0HCZBS2KxUxFK7WedfumA6EWJOmFe8KDZc2Q6K+vFNZqBD3wMt3SPdMKXA9wvehakFxBY3ukTeYhDA==" length="4297414" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.4</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:31:07 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Queue: line up several copies and checks; they run one after another with their own progress bars, an overall queue bar, graphs and time left. The Dock icon shows queue progress. Check a Copy and copy planning list folders far faster on network shares, read both sides at once, and start copying right away. Check a Copy has a live view with a speed graph and time left.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.4/Stowmap-1.4.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Z3Zc6Sejntoce8k4XdK7uqEAAl37mGjidyGde0cQtB94antgJ6rydM3pRPXJ0JKazdf9ibGCpa+PctE8gRQKAw==" length="4235403" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:13:24 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.3.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The Copy &amp; Verify progress view now matches the design: larger ring, speed graph and per-destination lanes. Verify shows a note when a drive is reading well under its usual pace.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.3.1/Stowmap-1.3.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="dFHhR7CRafn8SVhWi6dFO8KrJq0bbMA7Tbsl0oywbe7i6SJJHmW3hG2H6CmPkv3n++/fcz/uOfAA29N6JSzVAw==" length="4017859" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:34:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New: Copy &amp; Verify with checksum verification to up to three destinations, and Check a Copy. Faster mapping of network shares. Time-left estimates. Permanent delete, with confirmation, on drives that have no Trash. Leave Feedback button.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.3/Stowmap-1.3.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="0RP6L549DRC5X0R1oYo1HOHjPP+zgvXPv3sH4FiXANCxG9bW4/XPTc/fSTX8614n3YGwOfNS90AM/ojwdn36BQ==" length="3942153" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.2.3</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:40:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>A network share&#x27;s map now shows only what is in that share. New Scan All Drives button. Drive rows show scan progress while scanning.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.2.3/Stowmap-1.2.3.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Cq0VbQpFAUlFPmBxQz3U78zFTVHox4h1Byh/U4TZtmnRG6rXD3+RURr6OCVXh+2DPC3H2A5Z65SMlaxS6ZLSAA==" length="3222398" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.2.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:27:19 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Duplicates now skips system and app files by default and lets you ignore any folder. Stowmap no longer offers macOS&#x27;s own files to the Collector.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.2.2/Stowmap-1.2.2.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zQfmTRg3DGi+TSuPArdkvJlwfnc7r1X/Cml2qZQJ3tNS49Qc4xNB7boNvD6vUGrwWbCaLNvObpr9wTCtnVqwCw==" length="3191786" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.2.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:18:47 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The Duplicates row in the sidebar shows a progress bar while it works. Verify shows a bar and percentage on each row and can be stopped. Adds a 10 GB minimum size.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.2.1/Stowmap-1.2.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qz7ayoLc0xuuREhpNBVGfx5aju9WXHjK1Ji5PrXT1Weaqjv5p65Hdvl4X2z6tV5nxg+O/1Q0PcM+ykL2bJk1CA==" length="3158528" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:48:54 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Duplicates now lists matching folders that open into their files, with one button to collect a whole side. Check a single drive from the Duplicates button in its header. Search and the duplicate check show a progress bar.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.2/Stowmap-1.2.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="eaLzzp6Wjh/wWnmLPeL4i+YI6ODO4oU3DxxiUloCYnHodZb4cxga2GCNqiSzg9btPJM1mwYmNW+19w/xY1IODA==" length="3114328" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:33:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New: search across every scanned drive (Cmd-F) and a Duplicates view that finds identical files across drives. Rescan your drives once so copies can be matched.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.1/Stowmap-1.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="sxQznT7BQnJOhubv9Rjjba2Fbka7RTbI6LxCpMLUK4r5FEQ83lErIJl90IxVEfU62WiAq9FYoNk/jPN84MxABg==" length="3005307" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:37:49 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.0.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>NAS shares from the same server now account for each other: scanned shares appear by name, and only the remainder shows as Elsewhere on this server.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/troymeekhof/stowmap/releases/download/v1.0.2/Stowmap-1.0.2.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="oWHf+eN0DNyVBunQ1vlOtaVLNtXkV44f+rT8QaQx/9XHzAr2XWkLLMuA9vsY0tSDKzigyucLf0KHZoALlA2bDg==" length="2701425" />
